   Per-declaration proof_shape and live consumers:
     sectorial: bind-only; consumer=result
     J_sq: bind-only; consumer=φ
     φ_apply: bind-only; consumer=semigroup_formula
     φ_continuous: bind-only; consumer=semigroup_formula
     semigroup_formula: bind-only; consumers=entry_bound, action
     entry_bound: bind-only; consumer=bounded
     bounded: bind-only; consumer=result
